    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence or Wisdom score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Keen Observer.</strong> Choose one of the following skills: Insight, Investigation, or Perception. If you lack proficiency with the chosen skill, you gain proficiency in it, and if you already have proficiency in it, you gain Expertise in it.</p><p><strong>Quick Search.</strong> You can take the Search action as a Bonus Action.</p>",
